<section id="faq" style="padding-top:24px"><div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
<h2>Renovation questions</h2>
<div style="margin-top:28px">
<details><summary>How long does a full-home renovation take?</summary><p>It depends on the size of the house, the scope and the permit review. After the consultation we give you a realistic schedule for design, permits and construction.</p></details>
<details><summary>How much does a full-home renovation cost?</summary><p>The cost depends on the size, the scope and the finishes you choose. Detailed drawings and selections let contractors price the same job, so you can compare quotes and plan a realistic budget.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you work outside Toronto?</summary><p>Yes. We are based in Etobicoke and work across the GTA, including Vaughan, North York, Mississauga, Richmond Hill, Markham and Oakville.</p></details>
</div></div></section>

